{
 "format": "grasp-gui-config",
 "version": 2,
 "package": "GRASPG",
 "id": "graspg1",
 "order": 21,
 "title": {
  "zh": "GRASPG 示例 1：Mo XXXVIII，与算例 1 相同的计算用 CSFG 完成",
  "en": "GRASPG example 1: Mo XXXVIII, the calculation of case 1 with CSFGs"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "GRASPG 作者的第一个示例 (graspgtest/script1/csfg)，需要装有 GRASPG 的 GRASP。物理内容与算例 1 相同：奇宇称 2s²2p、2p³ 和偶宇称 2s2p²，到 n = 6 的单、双激发按层拆分，逐层 MCDHF，再做含 Breit 和 QED 的 CI。组态列表是 CSFG 列表 (.g) 加标记轨道文件 (.l)：先给出激发数为 0 的多参考列表，再给出激发列表。能量与 GRASP2018 的结果相差约 1e-6 Hartree，用时约为十分之一。",
  "en": "The first example of the GRASPG authors (graspgtest/script1/csfg); needs GRASP with GRASPG installed. The physics is that of case 1: odd 2s²2p, 2p³ and even 2s2p², single and double excitations to n = 6 split into layers, MCDHF layer by layer, then CI with Breit and QED. The configuration lists are CSFG lists (.g) with labelling-orbital files (.l): the multireference lists with 0 excitations come first, then the excitation lists. The energies agree with GRASP2018 to about 1e-6 Hartree in about a tenth of the time."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "4 个 MPI 进程约 5 分钟",
  "en": "about 5 minutes with 4 MPI processes"
 },
